    "description": "Comprehensive integration tests for the CICS Banking Sample Application Carbon React UI covering three user stories:\n\n1. Create Customer with Age Validation (18-120 per docs, actual COBOL enforces max 150)\n2. View/Update Customer Details by ID or name with expandable account views\n3. Create Accounts with 10-account limit per customer\n\nAll successful transactions (except inquiries) are logged to PROCTRAN for audit purposes.",
